    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Coat 3 wells of a 6 well plate with  1 mL  Matrigel (supplemented with RGD fragment)\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "1",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709260,
    "guid": "3B54A7D0323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709259,
    "previous_guid": "222B0150323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": "#A492FF",
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Aspirate media from cells in culture.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "2",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709261,
    "guid": "418A9F10323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709260,
    "previous_guid": "3B54A7D0323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Wash with  1 mL - 2 mL  PBS per well.\n\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "3",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709262,
    "guid": "5042A070323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709261,
    "previous_guid": "418A9F10323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Add  1 mL  Accutase per well.\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "4",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709263,
    "guid": "5BBA1CD0323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709262,
    "previous_guid": "5042A070323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Incubate at  37 \u00b0C for  00:10:00  to achieve single cells.\n\n\n\nIndividual donor lines exhibit variable sensitivity to accutase-mediated dissociation. Monitor cells regularly to identify when cells achieve single cells.\n \n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "5",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709264,
    "guid": "6F60C860323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709263,
    "previous_guid": "5BBA1CD0323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Collect cells in 5 mL DMEM/F12 and transfer to a 15mL conical tube.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "6",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709265,
    "guid": "3DC8E6B0323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709264,
    "previous_guid": "6F60C860323511E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Spin at 750-800 rpm for  00:03:00 .\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "7",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709266,
    "guid": "49F470D0323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709265,
    "previous_guid": "3DC8E6B0323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Aspirate media.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "8",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709267,
    "guid": "4FAAB0C0323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709266,
    "previous_guid": "49F470D0323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": " Resuspend cells in mTesR1 supplemented with 5 uM Rock Inhibitor.",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "9",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709268,
    "guid": "5A933390323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709267,
    "previous_guid": "4FAAB0C0323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Plate several dilutions of cells over the three wells (typically 25 \u03bcl, 50 \u03bcl and 75 \u03bcl in 2 mL of mTesR1).\n",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "10",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
    "id": 709269,
    "guid": "8AA6F0D0323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "previous_id": 709268,
    "previous_guid": "5A933390323611E9B885BB6FFDC33622",
    "section": null,
    "section_color": null,
    "section_duration": 0,
    "is_substep": false,
    "step": "Freeze down the remaining cells by adding an equal volume of 2x iPSC Freezing Media (20% DMSO in FBS).",
    "data": null,
    "protocol_id": 20446,
    "case_id": 0,
    "critical_ids": "",
    "duration": 0,
    "original_id": 0,
    "number": "11",
    "cases": [],
    "critical": null
   },
   {
